# Veteran Beastrider: "At the beginning of your end step, untap each creature you control." Bot1's Llanowar Elves taps for
# mana to cast the Beastrider on turn 3 and is untapped again on turn 4, though it would otherwise stay tapped until Bot1's
# next untap step. It is Bot1's creatures only: Bot2's Elves, tapped on turn 4, is still tapped once the trigger has resolved in Bot1's
# turn-5 end step ("you control"); and nothing triggers at the beginning of Bot2's end step on turn 4 ("your end step", CR 513.1).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Llanowar Elves
Veteran Beastrider
Island
Island
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Island x16

